  "idea": "Automated contractor payroll calculation based on completed tasks",
  "text": "This workflow tracks task completions in ClickUp and calculates contractor pay automatically. Tracking hourly timesheets creates friction when logged hours do not match actual client deliverables. Disconnected billing spreadsheets force tedious audit cycles that delay contractor payments and damage team morale. Use a Make automation that calculates milestone pay upon QA approval and syncs directly to QuickBooks. You guarantee accurate payouts while scaling output without extra stress.",
